    "roles": ["band_member", "bandleader", "composer", "educator", "percussionist"],
    "summary": "With Kenny Clarke, the first bebop drummer: the time on the ride cymbal, the hi-hat foot on 2 and 4, the bass drum for accents. Parker's drummer on Ko-Ko, co-leader of the quintet with Clifford Brown, the drummer on Saxophone Colossus, and the leader of Jazz in 3/4 Time, We Insist! and Drums Unlimited. His solos are composed: a theme stated and varied, often over a foot ostinato, as in The Drum Also Waltzes. In comping and in his fours he phrases in 3/4 over the 4/4 (Todd Bishop's transcriptions)."
  },
